1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760
Dexter P: Do you remember when we played Catten with Bobby last Friday?

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:10,010
Milo P: Yeah. Technically I lost, because he built the longest road and refused to trade me a single sheep. It's a tyranny.

3
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:15,280
Dexter P: Tell me... do you not feel something... when you watch him play like that?

4
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:21,260
Milo P: Wha... what? Feel what? Like, indigestion? I did eat a lot of pretzels.

5
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:33,930
Dexter P: The way he moves the pieces... the way he builds. That long... magnificent road of his.  And the way he murmurs, ore for wheat.

6
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:39,570
Milo P: I... guess? His settlement placement is, uh, statistically very good?

7
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:45,640
Dexter P: And when he rolled a seven and moved the robber?  I had to leave the room.

8
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,700
Milo P: Dude. We were playing in your room.

9
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:53,250
Dexter P: So... do you also find him sexy when he plays Catten?
